From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dwmapi: a thumbnail shows a source's change within 200 ms after a quiet spell

3714 slowed the thumbnail thread to one round a second after ten rounds with nothing to do, so a source that changed after a quiet spell showed it up to a second later; test-dwmthumb (5500) allows 600 ms and its live-right check failed about four times in ten. Idle rounds are 200 ms now (thumbnails that keep fighting over one destination still slow to a second). A thumbnail hidden while the thread was drawing it is also taken back (the destination repaints), as an unregistered one was.
---
diff --git a/dlls/dwmapi/dwmapi_main.c b/dlls/dwmapi/dwmapi_main.c
index 744fcc6..ff34507 100644
--- a/dlls/dwmapi/dwmapi_main.c
+++ b/dlls/dwmapi/dwmapi_main.c
@@ -1098,10 +1098,18 @@ static DWORD WINAPI thumbnail_thread_proc( void *arg )
         LONG activity;
         DWORD timeout;
 
-        /* Pictures are looked at every 50 ms while they change, every second
-         * once ten rounds found nothing to do, and not at all while no
-         * thumbnail is visible: the thread sleeps until the properties change. */
+        /* Pictures are looked at every 50 ms while they change, every 200 ms
+         * once ten rounds found nothing to do, every second when they keep
+         * changing for 2 s (thumbnails fighting over one destination), and not
+         * at all while no thumbnail is visible: the thread sleeps until the
+         * properties change.  Idle rounds were a second: a source that changed
+         * after a quiet spell showed it up to a second later (test-dwmthumb's
+         * live-right check failed about four times in ten). */
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_THUMB_IDLE_SECOND
+        timeout = waiting ? INFINITE : (quiet < 10 && busy < 40) ? 50 : busy >= 40 ? 1000 : 200;
+#else
         timeout = waiting ? INFINITE : (quiet < 10 && busy < 40) ? 50 : 1000;
+#endif
 #ifdef SG_MUTANT_THUMB_SPIN
         timeout = 0;
 #endif
@@ -1141,7 +1149,7 @@ static DWORD WINAPI thumbnail_thread_proc( void *arg )
         for (i = 0; i < count; i++)
         {
             RECT rect;
-            BOOL gone;
+            BOOL gone, hidden;
 
             pic = find_picture( work[i].id );
             if (!pic)
@@ -1178,10 +1186,12 @@ static DWORD WINAPI thumbnail_thread_proc( void *arg )
             EnterCriticalSection( &thumbnail_cs );
             t = find_thumbnail( work[i].id );
             gone = !t || !t->visible || t->generation != work[i].generation;
-            if (gone && !t) rect = thumbnail_dest_rect( &work[i] );
+            /* hidden while it was drawn, too: nothing paints it again (6121) */
+            hidden = t && !t->visible;
+            if (gone && (!t || hidden)) rect = thumbnail_dest_rect( &work[i] );
             LeaveCriticalSection( &thumbnail_cs );
 #ifndef SG_MUTANT_THUMB_NO_INVALIDATE
-            if (gone && !t && IsWindow( work[i].dest )) InvalidateRect( work[i].dest, &rect, TRUE );
+            if (gone && (!t || hidden) && IsWindow( work[i].dest )) InvalidateRect( work[i].dest, &rect, TRUE );
 #endif
         }
         tick++;
